<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16240" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">escārĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Pertaining to food</i>, <i>eating</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mensa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 120</span></i>
			 Müll.; cf. Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest.
				p. 77, 11</span></i> Müll.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vasa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 26, 67, § 198</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">argentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 34, 2, 19, § 12</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">34, 2,
				32, § 2</span></i>; and <i>absol.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">escāria</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i><span class="en">Juv. 12,
			46</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uvae,</span>”
				<i>fit for eating</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 3, 4, § 42</span></i>
			. —* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Of</i> or <i>belonging to bait</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vincla,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Men. 1, 1, 18</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
